CNN panelist says that it’s Trump’s fault that the Iranians tried to assassinate him:  

“If he hadn’t…waste[d] taxpayer money to have his little new plane and show it off and make a big deal about it when it wasn’t secure, none of this ever would have happened. It’s a situation of his own making.” 

@Jesse_Leg: “That is totally divorced from the fact that the problem here is the Iranians trying to kill our president…let’s not forget that the bad guys are the terrorists.”

